    <div class="lux-brand-news-sheet"><header><p class="lux-brand-news-meta"><span>October 24, 2026</span><span>Exhibition Preview</span><span>LuxurEat</span></p><h1 id="lux-reader-title">LuxurEat at FHC Shanghai 2026: Exploring Italian Flavours, Starting with Breakfast</h1><p class="lux-brand-news-intro">Meet us November 10–12, 2026, at Shanghai New International Expo Centre, Hall N3 · Booth N3A10.</p><a class="lux-brand-news-source" href="https://www.fhcchina.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FHC Shanghai official website ↗</a></header><div class="lux-brand-news-copy"><p>A family gathers around the table for freshly made pancakes, each person choosing a flavour to start the day. This is the everyday moment LuxurEat hopes to share at FHC Shanghai 2026.</p><p>We will use breakfast to explore new ways to enjoy our specialty products. One of the highlights will be the TrufflElixir range of truffle-flavoured drizzles.</p><section class="lux-reader-section"><h2>What else can go on breakfast besides maple syrup?</h2><p>TrufflElixir combines truffle with sweet and fruity notes, offering an alternative topping for pancakes, waffles and other breakfast favourites.</p><p>The idea is simple: let people discover different truffle flavours through familiar breakfast pairings. A drizzle over a pancake can begin a new taste experience.</p></section><section class="lux-reader-section"><h2>Bringing truffle to the family breakfast table</h2><p>Truffle often brings restaurants and festive meals to mind. With TrufflElixir, we want to explore more everyday occasions, especially breakfast at home.</p><p>For families with children and teenagers, straightforward pairings can help everyone discover flavours and find their own favourite combination.</p><p>Learning about the product, trying different pairings and finding a place for it at the family table are ideas we look forward to exploring with the Chinese market.</p></section><section class="lux-reader-section"><h2>Meeting China&#39;s food industry in person</h2><p>LuxurEat will appear at FHC alongside Truffleat, CaviarEat and Ugolini Gourmet.</p><p>We invite importers, distributors, retail and ecommerce buyers, and professionals from hotels, cafés, bakeries and restaurants to visit our booth, explore product uses and discuss partnership opportunities.</p><p>From home and hotel breakfasts to cafés and retail shelves, we look forward to bringing more flavour choices to consumers with our partners.</p><figure class="lux-brand-news-media"><img width="800" height="569" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/brand-news/fhc-chefs-shifair.webp'); ?>" alt="Chefs demonstrating at an FHC event"><figcaption>Image source: <a href="https://www.shifair.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shifair</a></figcaption></figure></section><section class="lux-reader-section"><h2>FHC Shanghai Global Food Trade Show 2026</h2><p>Dates: November 10–12, 2026</p><p>Venue: Shanghai New International Expo Centre (SNIEC)</p><p>Hall: N3</p><p>Booth: N3A10</p><p>Contact us through www.luxureat.cn to arrange a business meeting during the show.</p><p>See you in Shanghai. Let&#39;s start with breakfast and discover the world of LuxurEat flavours.</p></section><a class="lux-brand-news-event-link" href="<?php echo esc_url(luxureat_static_url('en/brand', '#event-fhc-shanghai-2026')); ?>"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/events/fhc-shanghai-2026-160.webp'); ?>" alt=""><span><small>Exhibitions &amp; Events</small><strong>LuxurEat (露意膳) at FHC Shanghai Global Food Trade Show</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="lux-brand-news-event-link" href="<?php echo esc_url(luxureat_static_url('en/news/fhc-shanghai-2026-pancakes')); ?>"><img width="1600" height="900" srcset="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/brand-news/fhc-breakfast-pairings-2026-720.webp'); ?> 720w, <?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/brand-news/fhc-breakfast-pairings-2026.webp'); ?> 1600w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 767px) 100vw, 960px" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri() . '/assets/media/brand-news/fhc-breakfast-pairings-2026.webp'); ?>" alt=""><span><small>Related Article</small><strong>What Else Can You Drizzle on Breakfast Pancakes Besides Maple Syrup?</strong></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div>
